      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This exceptional 4 bedroomed, two storey detached residence is perfectly positioned in the mature sought after development of Oaklawn, Pearse Road, Sligo.\r\n\r\nPresented in immaculate turnkey condition, this property boasts impressive B Energy Rating ensuring modern energy efficiency.  Combined with its unbeatable location within walking distance of Sligo Town Centre, opposite the Sligo Park Hotel and Leisure Centre, and close to Markievicz Park."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Ground Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - 6.5m x 2.0m \r\nTimber Flooring\nStairway\nStorage\r\n\r\nGuest WC - \r\nTiled\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 6.5m x 3.5m \r\nBay Window\nFeature Fireplace\nDouble doors to kitchen\nSolid Timber Flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 5.55m x 4.1m \r\nTimber Flooring\nWall and Floor Units\nIntegrated Cooker, Fridge/Freezer\nDishwasher\nWashing Machine\nTiled\nRear/side exit door.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 4.0m x 2.4m \r\nLaminate Flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.1m x 4.3m \r\nBuilt in Wardrobe\nEnsuite: (c. 1.8 m x 1.44 m)\nShower, WC, WHB.\nFully tiled.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m x 2.35m \r\nBuilt in Wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.37m x 2.45m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.7m x 3.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom & Toilet: - 2.15m x 1.8m \r\nShower, WC, WHB.\nFully Tiled\nHeated Towel Rail.\r\n\r\nHot press - \r\n\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nRear Garden\nPatio Area\nLarge Corner Site\nGarage:  c. 5.8 m x 3.6 m)   Roller Shutter door.\r\n\r\n"
